         guidepost 20 m away (Col de Granon): legs 21 T - P (Prapic), 22 P - Q
         (Les Combes) and 23 Q - T close a 10.2 km loop that relation 2001
         Tour des Combes, an ordinary route, also walks; legs 24 T - U (La
